true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-and-quantum-tech-will-transform-healthcare-and-medical-research</guid></item><item><title>联合国卫生机构警告称，由于 3000 万儿童错过疫苗接种，全球麻疹病例激增</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/global-measles-cases-surge-as-30-million-children-miss-vaccines-un-health-agency-warns</link><description>联合国世界卫生组织 (WHO) 周五警告说，自 2000 年以来，麻疹死亡人数下降了 88%，但去年估计仍有 95,000 人（其中大部分是儿童）死于该病毒。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/global-measles-cases-surge-as-30-million-children-miss-vaccines-un-health-agency-warns.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 01:06:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/global-measles-cases-surge-as-30-million-children-miss-vaccines-un-health-agency-warns</guid></item><item><title>指数：2026 年全球目前有 2,377,441 例登革热病例</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/index-2377441-dengue-fever-cases-globally-currently-in-2026</link><description>我们汇集了 70 多个国家报告的登革热数据，并使用先进的模型来填补空白，提供近乎实时的洞察，了解全球登革热季节的发展情况。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/index2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 00:51:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/index-2377441-dengue-fever-cases-globally-currently-in-2026</guid></item><item><title>埃博拉紧急情况八周后，英国开始首次疫苗试验</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/uk-starts-first-vaccine-trial-eight-weeks-into-ebola-emergency</link><description>英国药品监管机构已批准在健康成年人身上测试一种实验性疫苗。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/uk-starts-first-vaccine-trial-eight-weeks-into-ebola-emergency.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 00:36:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/uk-starts-first-vaccine-trial-eight-weeks-into-ebola-emergency</guid></item></channel></rss>